  "notes": {
    "14b8e18c": "The HEAD sampler mislabelled ~1/1000 scenes: boxes sharing or overlapping a diagonal's bounding box (e.g. two diagonals in one 2x2 box) draw a merged solid square that the constructor left unmarked, contradicting the canonical solid-2x2 marking. Random scenes now require disjoint boxes or strict nesting inside a hollow box; explicit scenes are unchanged.",
    "03560426": "Fixed-width requests are built from feasible width/height compositions (all feasible box counts and trailing blanks reachable, e.g. 6x30 needs five 5x2 boxes); the free-width default keeps its bounded rejection sampler."
  },
  "deferred": {
    "22806e14": "Archived independent verifier (erase plus when fewer than 5 odd squares) disagrees with the constructor (row/column alignment) on 160/300 fresh HEAD scenes; standard recertification cannot pass without a reviewed verifier, which is outside this batch's scope. Left unchanged."
  }
